  "title": "Slow Cooker Steak Fajitas",
  "description": "These crockpot steak fajitas feature tender, slow-cooked strips of flank steak tossed in a deliciously spiced tomato sauce with onions and bell peppers.",
  "authors": [
    "Miguel Ruiz"
  ],
